# FX P&L Trading Room Platform

Automated FX Profit & Loss monitoring platform for a trading room, in MAD. Built as a data pipeline — ingestion, transformation, calculation, orchestration, data quality — not a single app.

**Author:** Mohamed Taha El Qassid · Data Engineering, UIR · PFA Internship, DXC Technology

## What it does

- Calculates MTM, Realized, and Unrealized P&L (FIFO & WAC)
- Automates the full daily pipeline with Apache Airflow
- Enforces `total = realized + unrealized` at the database level
- Pulls real FX market rates, not just synthetic data
- Includes a statistical exposure-risk model and a backtested market-structure signal
- Live Streamlit dashboard on top

## Architecture
CSV / Live Rates → PostgreSQL → dbt (SQL) → Python Engine (FIFO/WAC) → Airflow → dbt Tests → Dashboard


## Stack

PostgreSQL · dbt · Apache Airflow · Python · Streamlit · Docker Compose

## Run it

```bash
docker compose up -d
pip install -r requirements.txt
python ingestion/load_csv.py
cd fx_pnl_dbt && dbt deps && dbt run && dbt test && cd ..
python engine/run_daily_pnl.py
streamlit run dashboard/app.py
```

## Tests

```bash
python tests/test_case_study.py
python tests/test_risk_model.py
```

## Notes

- Case study data; real trading-room data is confidential and unavailable at this stage.
- Market-structure signal is a technical indicator, not investment advice.
